# ---- Claude Code infrastructure (revised 2026-08-10, /research v1) -------
# Shared research infrastructure is VERSION-CONTROLLED. Charter section 9 treats
# code, interfaces and tooling as first-class scientific outputs, and the
# `/research` guarantees (no state writes, no push, no HPC) are only auditable
# if the rules enforcing them are in git.
#
# Ignore everything under .claude/ by default, then re-include the shared parts.
# Order matters: .claude/* must not be .claude/, or the negations cannot apply.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/workflows/
!.claude/commands/

# Machine- and session-specific. Never tracked.
#   settings.local.json  per-machine permission grants
#   worktrees/           git worktree checkouts
#   launch.json          local debug config; it targets notebooks/, which is
#                        itself gitignored, so it is not shared infrastructure
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/launch.json

# LaTeX build artifacts
continuousmeasurementslatex/
continuousmeasurementslatex/*.aux
continuousmeasurementslatex/*.bbl
continuousmeasurementslatex/*.blg
